You may integrate the Software into your own internal systems and automate your
internal workflows, provided those systems do not offer the Software or its
functionality to third parties as a Commercial Offering.

You may engage and pay contractors to install, configure, modify, or maintain
copies solely for your permitted personal or Internal Use. Those contractors
