(d) Use a free distribution or intermediary to carry out any of (a) through (c).

Ordinary interoperability with third-party tools for your own personal or
Internal Use, such as calendar connections, AI providers, exports, and internal
MCP clients, remains permitted. This license does not restrict independently
developed software merely because it interoperates with the Software.

To request permission for a restricted use, contact Michael Ma through
